---
title: Filspresso Next - Stock-Safe Checkout Flow
---

flowchart TD
    A[User adds item to cart] --> B[NestJS validates inventory]
    B --> C[Compute reserved qty by other active carts]
    C --> D{Enough reservable stock?<br/>(stock - reserved >= requested)}
    D -->|No| E[409 Conflict: insufficient stock]
    D -->|Yes| F[Persist cart_item row]
    F --> G[User initiates checkout]
    G --> H[NestJS begins transaction]
    H --> I[SELECT ... FOR UPDATE<br/>lock product rows]
    I --> J{stock >= requested quantity?<br/>(guarded decrement check)}
    J -->|No| K[ROLLBACK + 409 conflict]
    J -->|Yes| L[Decrement stock column]
    L --> M[Create order + order_items rows]
    M --> N[Delete cart_items for this account]
    N --> O[COMMIT transaction]
    O --> P[POST to Go Ops: order.created event]
    P --> Q[Go Ops appends to Redis ops:events]

    style E fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#991b1b
    style K fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#991b1b
    style O fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#22c55e,color:#166534
    style Q fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#22c55e,color:#166534
